These fixtures contain the 1,008-lane FP16 input and output of the
MobileNet V1 softmax LUT stage captured on RK3588 hardware.  The first
1,001 input lanes are shifted logits and the final seven lanes are zero.
All 1,008 lanes are active in this stage.

The input and output files are base64-encoded little-endian FP16 byte
streams, each decoding to 2,016 bytes.  ``lut-fp16.base64`` contains table 0
followed by table 1 as 513 little-endian 16-bit entries per table.  These are
test evidence only and do not constrain the device model by task number,
model name, or tensor shape.

Decoded SHA-256 hashes:

* input: 2e619deedc057222d39ccf7cf9affee44765876637ccae381e9eebc71e5a6c40
* LUT: 46bf8be7ace6b4e3ea6063161763fb05a0f4c443ce9baef7b6abbbf3f2523c23
* output: 6a1069256c357e5b4c26b824a50c8029ef40a81adf71780c2eff03418ffe107d
